---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ExternalLink from '../components/ExternalLink.astro';
import { TV_PROFILE } from '../data/indicators';
import { OWNER, OWNER_DISPLAY } from '../data/owner';
---

<Layout title="About" description="Itto-Ryu Tech: free Pine Script indicators, grown with patience.">
  <article class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 pt-16">
    <span lang="ja" class="vertical absolute right-4 sm:right-6 top-16 text-lg tracking-[0.15em] text-usu" aria-hidden="true">明鏡止水</span>
    <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-koke font-medium">About</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl leading-[1.5] font-medium pr-10 text-pretty">
      <span class="block">A bonsai is not made in a day.</span>
      <span class="block mt-3">It is grown with patience and shaped by careful cuts. Trading is the same.</span>
    </h1>
    <div class="mt-10 space-y-5 leading-relaxed max-w-[65ch]">
      <p>
        Itto-Ryu Tech is a one-person practice by {OWNER_DISPLAY}, a trader who writes Pine
        Script indicators, most of them open-source, and publishes them free on{' '}
        <ExternalLink href={TV_PROFILE} class="underline text-koke hover:text-matsuba">TradingView</ExternalLink>.
      </p>
      <p>
        The name borrows <span lang="ja">一刀</span> (ittō), Japanese for “a single cut”. Here it means the one
        deliberate cut a gardener makes when shaping a tree. The guiding phrase <span lang="ja">明鏡止水</span>
        (<i lang="ja-Latn">meikyō shisui</i>, “a clear mirror, still water”) is a reminder that a still mind reads
        the chart more clearly.
      </p>
      <p class="text-usu">
        Itto-Ryu Tech is not affiliated with any Ittō-ryū school of swordsmanship, and is not affiliated with
        or endorsed by TradingView.
      </p>
    </div>
    <section class="mt-12 border-t border-line pt-8 max-w-[65ch]" aria-labelledby="author">
      <h2 id="author" class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-koke font-medium">Owner and developer</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 font-serif text-2xl font-medium">{OWNER_DISPLAY}</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-usu">{OWNER.role}</p>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
        Owns and develops Itto-Ryu Tech: the indicators, this website and its code. On TradingView as{' '}
        <ExternalLink href={TV_PROFILE} class="underline text-koke hover:text-matsuba">Thiranat</ExternalLink>.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="mt-10 rounded-md bg-kinu p-5 max-w-[65ch] text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-koke font-medium">Disclaimer</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">
        For education only. Not investment advice. Indicators describe market conditions; they do not predict
        prices. <a href="/disclaimer" class="underline hover:text-sumi">Read the full disclaimer</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
